    "# 8. Gene-Query JEPA embedding analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Notebook **05** analyses on the **full-LPS JEPA winner**. Same cell names (`adata`, `adata_full`, `new_adata`, `myeloids`). Count decoder IL1B KO: `09_GeneQuery_JEPA_CountDecoder_Analysis.ipynb`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Dump is `--eval-split all` (148,107 pairing rows). §8.3 collapses to unique LPS `cell_pairing_index` (~69,531), matching MaskGIT 05. Genes: the same **1,856** HVG tokens.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Piece | What you get |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| ckpt | `fzT_thenU5_vic1_contr0.3_q128_predL1` `epoch=09.ckpt` |\n",
    "| dump | sod2 `.../embeddings/full_vic1_contr0.3_q128_predL1_eval_all/embeddings/` |\n",
    "| cells | unique LPS: `cls_embeddings` = mean `z_hat` |\n",
    "| genes | `varm` `90m_LPS` / `6h_LPS` / `10h_LPS` (hat) |\n",
    "\n",
    "**What is paired with 05 (no PCA-50):**\n",
    "- cell UMAP: `sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='cls_embeddings')` then UMAP\n",
    "- gene programs: `sc.pp.neighbors(new_adata)` + Leiden `r1`\n",
    "- expression `adata_full` PCA+UMAP, Enrichr, highlight, myeloid violin\n",
    "\n",
    "**Not in 05 (keep PCA-50 if they use it):** src/hat/tgt stack, cosine table, §8.5 probe.\n",
    "\n",
    "Cytokine Leiden is **13** here (05 used **19**). Re-dump only if `FORCE_DUMP = True`.\n"
   ]
  },
