    "## 8.3. Unique cells, then the notebook 05 cell UMAP\n",
    "\n",
    "Collapse pairing duplicates to unique `cell_pairing_index` (MaskGIT `mean_duplicates`). Then the **same cell UMAP as 05**:\n",
    "\n",
    "`sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='cls_embeddings')` → `sc.tl.umap(adata)`\n",
    "\n",
    "That is 768-d `z_hat`, **not** PCA-50. Notebook 04 used PCA-50; we do not use that for the 05 comparison.\n",
    "\n",
    "Src / tgt stay in `z_src_cell` / `z_tgt_cell` for extras below.\n"
   ]
  },
