      "stacked UMAP subsample: 69000 unique cells x 3 embeddings\n",
      "WARNING: saving figure to file /mnt/sod2-project/csb4/stuke1/perturbgen/gene_query_jepa/embeddings/full_vic1_contr0.3_q128_predL1_eval_all/embeddings/gene_program_discovery/figures/umap_jepa_cell_src_hat_tgt_unique.png\n"
